==History==
2016
*The Minions [[Cards|card]] was added with [[Version History#Softlaunch on iOS (4/1/2016)|Clash Royale's game launch]] on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]] decreased the Minions' Sight Range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]] increased the {{Rarity|Common}} card Level Cap to 13 (from 12) {{Balance|Buff}}. The update also fixed the "range bug" by decreasing the Minions' Range to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, but maintaining their effective Range.
2018
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer 2018 Update (20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]] gave the Minions a new a delay between each other when deployed, with a Minion spawning 0.15 seconds after the previous one {{Balance|Add}}. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] required to unlock this card from Bone Pit to [[Training Camp]] {{Balance|Buff}}.
2019
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July 2019 Update (1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]] decreased the Minions' Range to 1.6 tiles (from 2 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, classifying their Range as "Melee: Long".
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]] decreased the delay between each Minion deployment to 0.1 seconds (from 0.15 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/11/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/11/2020)|Balance Update]] added a card render to the Minions' card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions Update (27/10/2021)|Champions Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 7/12/2022, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/12/2022)|Balance Update]] increased the Minions' Damage by 15% {{Balance|Buff}}.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card Evolution Update (19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]] made it so that Minions' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the Arena they were placed {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Minions' Hitpoints by 16% {{Balance|Buff}} and their Range to 2.5 tiles (from 1.6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}, removing their Melee range classification.
*On 7/8/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (7/8/2025)|maintenance break]], decreased the Minions' Hitpoints by 14%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 1/9/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/9/2025)|Balance Update]] increased the Minions' Attack Period to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second){{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History #Balance Changes (6/10/2025|Balance Update]] decreased the Minions' Damage by 9%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 24/11/2025, the [[Version History#Level 16 Update (24/11/2025)|Level 16 Update]] increased the Level Cap of all cards to 16 (from 15){{Balance|Buff}}.
2026
*On 2/2/2026, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|February 2026 Update]] increased the Minions' Attack Period to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.

